  "description": "You're short on rent? Don't worry, I'm sure you can... make it up to me in other ways. Welcome to DesireVille.\n\n**Original Webtoon:**      \n[Ridibooks](https://ridibooks.com/books/3587012472), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=12260162), [MrBlue](https://www.mrblue.com/comic/C000067578), [Toomics](https://www.toomics.com/webtoon/episode/toon/8527), [Mootoon](https://www.mootoon.co.kr/comic/moo_list.mg?tcode=ve56), [QToon](https://www.qtoon.co.kr/toon/list.mg?tcode=p4jc), MeToon\n\n**Official Translations:**   \nEnglish: [Toomics](https://toomics.com/en/webtoon/episode/toon/8527), [HoneyToon](https://honeytoon.com/comic/desire-village)   \nFrench: [Toomics](https://toomics.com/fr/webtoon/episode/toon/8527), [HoneyToon](url)   \nGerman: [Toomics](https://toomics.com/de/webtoon/episode/toon/8527), [HoneyToon](https://honeytoon.com/de/comic/dorf-der-begierde)    \nSpanish: [Toomics](https://toomics.com/esp/webtoon/episode/toon/8527), [HoneyToon](https://honeytoon.com/es/comic/aldea-del-deseo)      \nItalian: [Toomics](https://toomics.com/it/webtoon/episode/toon/8527), [HoneyToon](https://honeytoon.com/it/comic/villaggio-del-desiderio)    \nOthers: [S.Chinese](https://toomics.com/sc/webtoon/episode/toon/8527), [T.Chinese](https://toomics.com/tc/webtoon/episode/toon/8527), [B.Portuguese](https://honeytoon.com/pt/comic/vila-do-desejo)",
